# ----------------------------------------------------------
# PI-HOLE BLOCKLIST: ONLINE GAMING
# Launchers, storefronts, major titles, console services,
# cloud gaming, mobile/SEA publishers, browser game portals,
# Android emulators, and DNS/VPN bypass endpoints.
#
# Apply to a restricted group only - on Default this blocks
# gaming for every device in the house.
#
# NOTE: four pattern rules cannot live in a subscribed list,
# because gravity lists hold domains, not regexes. Add these
# by hand as Regex deny entries or the "unblocked games"
# mirror sites will walk straight around this file:
#     unblocked
#     tyrone
#     freegames?[0-9]
#     gamesfree
#
# Excludes nintendo.* on purpose - collides with the
# accounts.nintendo.com allow rules needed by the Switches.
# ----------------------------------------------------------
